<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH2b1559-zh-e1c284f3" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>嵇康集</title><editor role="translator">Wu Xiucheng 武秀成导读</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>嵇康集</title>北京：凤凰出版社，2020</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH2b1559"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="zh">modern Chinese</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-05-11T17:23:32.153+09:00</date> by CH</creation><creation resp="#CH">Header modified: <date>2026-05-11T18:19:09.476+09:00</date> by CH</creation><creation resp="#CH">Header modified: <date>2026-05-11T18:20:54.231+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH2b1559-start"><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:03:08.84+09:00"> 有一位秦地来的客人向东野主人问道：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:03:23.717+09:00">“我听前人论述说：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:03:38.18+09:00">‘太平时代的音乐安详而且欢乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:03:53.975+09:00">亡国的音乐悲哀而且忧伤。’</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:07:38.889+09:00">大凡国家的太平和动乱在于政事，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:07:50.689+09:00">而乐音声响与它相应和，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:08:10.703+09:00">所以悲哀和忧伤的感情</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:13:31.119+09:00">表露在铜钟石磐的打击乐上，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:16:14.055+09:00">安详和欢乐的形象</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:16:42.748+09:00">体现在箫管琴弦的鼓吹乐中。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:18:16.511+09:00">又像仲尼听到《韶》乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:20:19.875+09:00">能识别虞舜的德行；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:20:35.624+09:00">季札听到演奏‘风雅’，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:22:54.535+09:00">能知道是哪国的民谣。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:23:10.365+09:00">这些是过去历史上的事情，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:27:11.884+09:00">是古代的贤人所不怀疑的。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:27:49.189+09:00">现在您却偏偏认为声音本身没有哀乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:28:05.621+09:00">这理由在哪里？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:35:58.889+09:00">若有高论，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:36:16.692+09:00">请说给我听听！”</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:36:26.262+09:00">主人回答他说：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T21:41:51.242+09:00">“这种观念长久滞留在人们心里，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:17:41.842+09:00">没有人肯加以改变，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:18:15.591+09:00">所以使历代</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:18:20.773+09:00">都弄不清它的名和实的关系。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:18:42.861+09:00">现在承蒙您启发开导，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:19:31.542+09:00">我就讲讲这个道理的某一方面吧。”</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:20:15.918+09:00">“天地融合的德惠，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:20:27.637+09:00">万物才能借以滋生，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:21:03.353+09:00">寒冬暑夏交替运行，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.33" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:21:18.67+09:00">五行因而形成，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.34" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:21:30.877+09:00">可以表现为五色，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.35" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:21:38.765+09:00">发生为五音。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.36" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:22:19.184+09:00">乐音声响的作用，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.37" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:22:26.902+09:00">就像气味存在于天地之间。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.38" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:22:34.8+09:00">它的好和不好，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.39" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:22:43.195+09:00">即使遇到世事的变乱，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.40" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:23:07.374+09:00">它的本体还是保持原样</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.41" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:23:11.969+09:00">而没有改变的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.42" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:23:36.21+09:00">难道会因为人的爱好和憎恶而变换操守，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.43" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:24:17.156+09:00">因为人的悲哀和欢乐而改动度量吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.44" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:24:30.106+09:00">至于人按照不同的声调进行汇集排比起来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.45" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:25:39.223+09:00">使乐音声响能够和谐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.46" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:25:51.073+09:00">这是人们心中最高的愿望，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.47" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:26:08.361+09:00">也是人的情感欲望的聚集。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.48" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:26:30.502+09:00">古人知道情感不可放纵，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.49" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:26:46.549+09:00">欲望不能极端，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.50" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:26:58.206+09:00">所以按照它的需要，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.51" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:27:05.884+09:00">时常加以节制，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.52" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:27:12.807+09:00">使人的悲哀不至于伤害身心，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.53" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:27:19.991+09:00">欢乐不至没有限度。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.54" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:27:49.493+09:00">根据不同的事物给予不同的名称，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.55" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:28:36.424+09:00">每种东西都有自己的称号：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.56" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:28:44.325+09:00">哭泣叫做哀，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.57" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T22:28:58.584+09:00">歌唱称为乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.58" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:31:28.437+09:00">这是它们的大概情况。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.59" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-12T00:05:49.516+09:00">然而孔子说‘乐呀乐呀， [⑩“乐云”句：语出《论语·阳货》。原意是说，音乐难道仅仅是敲击钟鼓吗？这里，嵇康实际是诡辩，把音乐的“乐”故意读为哀乐的“乐”，遂引出下句“哀云哀云，哭泣云乎哉。"]</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.60" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:40:35.414+09:00">仅仅是说钟和鼓这些乐器吗？’</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.61" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:40:49.62+09:00">所谓悲哀，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.62" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:41:31.346+09:00">仅仅是说哭泣吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.63" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:41:51.564+09:00">按照这个来说，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.64" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:42:03.761+09:00">玉器、财帛不是礼仪的实质，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.65" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:42:40.884+09:00">歌唱、哭泣不是悲哀欢乐的主体。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.66" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:42:52.968+09:00">用什么来加以说明呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.67" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:42:59.667+09:00">不同的地方有不同的风俗，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.68" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:43:07.699+09:00">歌唱和哭泣的含意也不相同。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.69" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:43:19.15+09:00">假使错杂开来使用，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.70" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:43:26.412+09:00">有的地方听到哭泣就快乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.71" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:43:35.271+09:00">有的地方听得歌唱便悲伤，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.72" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:43:43.38+09:00">然而人的悲哀喜乐的感情却是一样的。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.73" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:43:49.646+09:00">现在用同样的感情，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.74" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:43:54.683+09:00">发出各种不同的声音，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.75" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:43:59.482+09:00">这不是乐音声响本身并没有一定的感情吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.76" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:44:17.173+09:00">然而声调乐音和谐地组合起来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.77" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:44:45.276+09:00">就是感人最深的东西。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.78" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:44:54.556+09:00">劳苦的人歌唱他的事情，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.79" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:45:00.743+09:00">欢乐的人用歌舞来表现他的功绩。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.80" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:45:06.829+09:00">内心有了悲痛的感情，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.81" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:45:13.096+09:00">就会激发出哀伤急切的言辞。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.82" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:45:19.271+09:00">语言组织成了诗篇，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.83" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:45:23.82+09:00">声调组织成了音乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.84" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:45:28.06+09:00">错杂起来反复咏唱，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.85" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:45:32.213+09:00">聚集起来侧耳倾听，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.86" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:45:39.13+09:00">心情被和谐的音乐所激动，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.87" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:47:57.354+09:00">情绪为忧伤的歌词所感染，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.88" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:48:22.839+09:00">感叹的声音还没有停止，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.89" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:49:04.155+09:00">眼泪就已经潸潸而下了。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.90" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:49:09.955+09:00">悲哀的感情藏在内心，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.91" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:49:39.324+09:00">遇到相应和谐的声音而后激发出来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.92" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:50:01.057+09:00">相应和谐的声音没有具体形象，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.93" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:50:06.942+09:00">而悲哀的感情却是有人主宰的。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.94" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:50:14.657+09:00">因为有人主宰的悲哀感情，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.95" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:50:29.822+09:00">凭借着没有具体形象的相应和谐的声音表现出来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.96" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:50:39.196+09:00">人们所感觉领悟到的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.97" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:50:45.01+09:00">只是悲哀罢了。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.98" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:50:53.216+09:00">哪里还知道庄子说的‘风吹孔鸣各种不同的美妙声音，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.99" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:51:04.131+09:00">都出于自然’呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.100" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:51:10.556+09:00">风谣习俗的流传，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.101" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:51:17.553+09:00">就形成了它所反映的政治，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.102" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:51:23.607+09:00">因此国家的史官根据风俗辨明政治教化的得失，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.103" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:51:29.762+09:00">审察各地民谣的盛衰，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.104" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:51:43.84+09:00">吟咏情性</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.105" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:51:57.337+09:00">来讽劝他的国君，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.106" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:52:05.852+09:00">所以说</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.107" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-11T23:54:21.285+09:00">‘亡国的音乐悲哀而忧伤’。”</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.108" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:14:03.613+09:00">“喜、怒、哀、乐、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.109" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:14:08.652+09:00">爱、憎、惭、惧，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.110" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:14:13.432+09:00">这八种情感，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.111" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:14:26.425+09:00">是人们用来接触事物，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.112" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:14:46.663+09:00">传达真情，彼此区别，各有所属，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.113" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:15:30.136+09:00">因而不能滥用的。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.114" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:15:58.092+09:00">味道用甜和苦来称呼，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.115" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:18:11.115+09:00">现在因为某甲贤明而心中喜爱他，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.116" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:18:34.784+09:00">因为某乙愚笨而感情上厌恶他，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.117" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:20:09.419+09:00">那么喜爱和厌恶的感情应该属于我，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.118" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:33:25.918+09:00">而贤和愚的性质应该属于他；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.119" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:34:00.002+09:00">难道可以因为我喜爱而称他为大家喜爱的人，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.120" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:34:06.605+09:00">我憎恨而称他为大家憎恨的人？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.121" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:40:42.606+09:00">对个人所喜欢的滋味就称作‘喜味'，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.122" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:41:01.201+09:00">对个人所恼怒的滋味就称作'怒味'吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.123" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:55:37.764+09:00">由此说来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.124" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:56:00.719+09:00">外物和内心有不同的作用，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.125" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:56:18.22+09:00">外物的客体和内心的主体有不同的名称，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.126" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T01:59:47.472+09:00">声响乐音自然）应当以好坏为主，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.127" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T04:38:56.934+09:00">那么就无关于哀乐；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.128" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T04:39:22.438+09:00">哀乐自然应当因为人的情感而后才表现出来；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.129" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T04:39:37.376+09:00">那么就和声音便没有关联。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.130" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T04:39:56.221+09:00">名和实一起去掉，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.131" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T04:40:37.159+09:00">那么就完全可以看清楚了。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.132" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T05:02:20.696+09:00">况且季札在鲁国，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.133" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T05:02:52.462+09:00">采访诗歌来观察礼治的得失，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.134" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T05:03:32.446+09:00">区别国风和雅诗，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.135" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T05:04:06.253+09:00">难道是单凭听声音来论定是非好坪吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.136" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T05:05:33.624+09:00">又如孔子听到《韶》乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.137" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T05:20:28.176+09:00">赞叹它话完整一致，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.138" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T05:20:43.21+09:00">所以长吁短叹，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.139" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T05:36:58.736+09:00">哪里一定是从声音中知道了虞舜的德行，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.140" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T05:37:06.384+09:00">然后才赞美它呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.141" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T05:37:30.519+09:00">现在我粗略地说明了音乐的某一方面，也可以理解大半了。"</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.142" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-18T05:40:03.695+09:00">也可以理解大半了。"</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>